  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1584283/description_bacc8ecc-1c0b-4f5d-802d-a641e4fd2213.gif\" alt=\"IcarusReWinged標題\" width=\"535\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/r3ynex\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/kofi-support%20me-55c6f9?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=55c6f9\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持 r3ynex\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://dalink.to/polinatassel\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/artist-polina__tess-55c6f9?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"藝術家 Polina Tess\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/icarus\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/required-icarus-e05d44?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"需要 Icarus 模組\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<h2 align=\"center\"><strong>Icarus</strong> 模組的<strong>非官方</strong>附加模組，全面翻新翅膀視覺效果，並新增自訂<strong>動態</strong>翅膀皮膚。</h2>\n<h3 align=\"center\">- 本模組也包含各種翅膀的合成配方，讓你在生存模式中也能自行製作！（自<strong>1.1.0</strong>版本起支援）</h3>\n\n---\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1584283/description_ff733f1b-a66f-4bdf-97b8-9edf24ed14d7.png\" alt=\"Icarus羽毛翅膀預覽\" width=\"850\">\n  <br><br>\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1584283/description_9e5ecd4d-6bba-45f9-9eb3-ccacf7621621.gif\" alt=\"羽毛翅膀\" width=\"850\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1584283/description_15319117-900e-45e7-a76d-f40e8612fc9a.png\" alt=\"Icarus膜翼預覽\" width=\"850\">\n  <br><br>\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1584283/description_aa25bc61-c30a-4f2c-afba-1273c9670abc.gif\" alt=\"膜翼\" width=\"850\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1584283/description_d6657711-4c93-42c7-aebb-4ce61e5145c8.png\" alt=\"Icarus蝴蝶翅膀預覽\" width=\"850\">\n  <br><br>\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a6a845f6-82b4-4859-8ad6-42c0e4a22701.gif\" alt=\"蝴蝶翅膀\" width=\"850\">\n</p>",
